window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>Queen of the Black Coast</i> by Robert E. Howard is one of the most iconic tales of Conan the Barbarian—a gripping fantasy adventure filled with passion, piracy, and peril.</p> <p>When Conan flees tyranny and joins the infamous pirate queen Bêlit, their fiery romance ignites a saga of blood-soaked raids, supernatural horrors, and tragic destiny. Set against a backdrop of cursed rivers, haunted lands, and ruthless battles, this early 20th-century sword-and-sorcery classic blends high-seas adventure with themes of love, honor, and loss.</p> <p>Perfect for fans of epic fantasy, pulp adventure, and timeless tales of heroism and doom.</p>"; 
